{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חֵ֫לֶם","hw":"חֵ֫לֶם","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫לֶם</span></big><sub>22</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:2\" href=\"/Daniel.4.2\">Dn 4:2</a> <strong>dream (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲלוֹם\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲלוֹם\", dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוֹם</a>, √ <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָלַם²\" href=\"/BDB,_חָלַם²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. חלם</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:2\" href=\"/Daniel.4.2\">Dn 4:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְמָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:4\" href=\"/Daniel.2.4\">2:4</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶלְמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">4:6</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">מָךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">2:28</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְמִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">5:12</a>;—<em>dream</em>, as vehicle or revelation <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:4\" href=\"/Daniel.2.4\">Dn 2:4</a> + 10 times, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:3\" href=\"/Daniel.4.3\">4:3</a> + 6 times, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">5:12</a>; to prophet <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֲלַף","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חָכְמָה"}